   "description": "Landen Agee | RB / ATH | C/O 2027\nNorth Lincoln High School (NC)\n\nExplosive, every-down running back with proven production and big-play ability.\n\nJunior Season \n1,375 rushing yards on 203 carries (6.8 YPC)\n16 TDs | 2× All-Conference\nMultiple Player of the Week honors\nPlayer of the Game (6–7×)\n\nSophomore Season:\n1,043 rushing yards on 105 carries (9.9 YPC)\n\nDynamic runner with strong vision, patience, and ability to create explosive plays at the second level. Physical finisher who runs through contact and competes every snap.\n\nVerified 4.46 laser 40-yard dash with multi-sport explosiveness (basketball dunk ability), translating to elite burst and acceleration.\n\nStudent-athlete with a 3.4 GPA, continuing to develop into a complete back (pass game + blocking).\n\nOn3 Profile: https://www.on3.com/rivals/landen-agee-285729/elite/network/",
